msgid ""
"The search interface is made of three sections: <strong>{}</strong>, "
"<strong>{}</strong>, and <strong>{}</strong>. These are described in "
"detail below."
msgstr ""
"Die Suchoberfläche besteht aus drei Bereichen: <strong>{}</strong>, "
"<strong>{}</strong>, und <strong>{}</strong>. Diese sind unten in "
"Einzelheiten beschrieben."

#: kerko/templates/kerko/_search-help.html.jinja2:16
#: kerko/templates/kerko/_search-help.html.jinja2:17
#: kerko/templates/kerko/_search-help.html.jinja2:49
